    {
      "id": "2017_special_der_ex04_q1",
      "display_order": 1,
      "content_type": "question",
      "text": "I) ادرس اتجاه تغير الدالة \\(g\\) ثم استنتج إشارة \\(g(x)\\).",
      "solution": {
        "strategy": "نحسب مشتقة \\(g\\)، ثم نحدد قيمتها الدنيا.",
        "steps": [
          {
            "step_number": 1,
            "title": "حساب المشتقة",
            "explanation": "\\[g'(x)=-2\\left(e^{-x}-xe^{-x}\\right)=2(x-1)e^{-x}\\]",
            "result": "\\[g'(x)=2(x-1)e^{-x}\\]"
          },
          {
            "step_number": 2,
            "title": "إشارة المشتقة",
            "explanation": "بما أن \\(e^{-x}>0\\) لكل \\(x\\)، فإن إشارة \\(g'(x)\\) هي إشارة \\(x-1\\). إذن \\(g\\) متناقصة تمامًا على \\(]-\\infty,1]\\)، ومتزايدة تمامًا على \\([1,+\\infty[\\)."
          },
          {
            "step_number": 3,
            "title": "القيمة الدنيا",
            "explanation": "\\[g(1)=1-\\frac{2}{e}\\] وبما أن \\(e>2\\)، فإن \\(1-\\frac2e>0\\).",
            "result": "\\[g(x)>0\\quad\\forall x\\in\\mathbb R\\]"
          }
        ],
        "variation_table": {
          "type": "variation_table",
          "title": "جدول تغيرات الدالة \\(g\\)",
          "function_name": "g(x)",
          "derivative_name": "g'(x)",
          "domain": "\\mathbb{R}",
          "x_values": [
            "-\\infty",
            "1",
            "+\\infty"
          ],
          "derivative_signs": [
            "-",
            "0",
            "+"
          ],
          "function": {
            "branches": [
              {
                "id": "g_left",
                "start_x": "-\\infty",
                "end_x": "1",
                "start_value": "+\\infty",
                "end_value": "1-2/e",
                "direction": "down"
              },
              {
                "id": "g_right",
                "start_x": "1",
                "end_x": "+\\infty",
                "start_value": "1-2/e",
                "end_value": "1",
                "direction": "up"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "sign_table": {
          "type": "sign_table",
          "title": "إشارة \\(g(x)\\)",
          "x_values": [
            "-\\infty",
